ponibile","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Soltera codiciada","overview":{"value":"Il film racconta la vita di Maria Fe, una giovane donna che affronta l'unicità dopo sei anni di relazione. Insieme ai suoi due migliori amici, interpretati da Karina Jordán e Jely Reátegui, la ragazza deve imparare ad essere single di nuovo. Lungo la strada si incontreranno vecchi amori, nuove avventure e tanto divertimento.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2018-05-31","status":"Released","rating":6.755,"ratingCount":253,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["Peru"],"facts":{"Runtime":"104m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1292820,"name":"Gisela Ponce de León","role":"María Fé","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ep7JvE8GG9lQji5jqWwctbS3TY.jpg"},{"id":1317371,"name":"Karina Jordán","role":"Natalia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9R14tvxpluYGy3EBtX1za9KIt5.jpg"},{"id":1543624,"name":"Jely Reategui","role":"Carolina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pEhAImblmcrSKKY77Fomz8JPcM.jpg"},{"id":1234169,"name":"Christopher Von Uckermann","role":"Santiago","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z0PjPIpADBSYI8gowdyDUssiTFR.jpg"},{"id":1456143,"name":"Carlos Carlín","role":"Ramiro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qu7zTzElXexKd83CObFs8hgf8x3.jpg"},{"id":1543621,"name":"Andrés Salas","role":"Matias","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RNxsQUwzk5PzXmO5bOqNqBfd5.jpg"},{"id":1169534,"name":"César Ritter","role":"Lorenzo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fX2sBRJIcWrm5Gds2am33NvWqIs.jpg"},{"id":1959052,"name":"Alessandra Fuller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xjDBejS50L3nxi0cU4WUoIwxV7q.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Single e disponibile","overview":"Il film racconta la vita di Maria Fe, una giovane donna che affronta l'unicità dopo sei anni di relazione. Insieme ai suoi due migliori amici, interpretati da Karina Jordán e Jely Reátegui, la ragazza deve imparare ad essere single di nuovo. Lungo la strada si incontreranno vecchi amori, nuove avventure e tanto divertimento."},{"language":"en-US","title":"How to Get Over a Breakup","overview":"The film tells the life of Maria Fe, a young woman who faces singleness after six years of relationship. Along with her two soul friends, played by Karina Jordán and Jely Reátegui, the girl must learn to be single again. On the way, you will run into old loves, new adventures and lots of fun."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Cuando su novio de 6 años le termina de un momento a otro, María Fe debe lidiar con un corazón roto que no parece curarse con nada. Después de varias noches de lágrimas -y alcohol- y alentada por sus amigas, decide desahogarse de la única manera que sabe hacerlo: escribiendo. El resultado es un blog donde se ríe de las desventuras de la soltería y las relaciones, y que tendrá un éxito inesperado. Pero cuando el fantasma del ex reaparece en su vida ¿podrá María Fe seguir sus propios consejos?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ngKYg4hgBlVvjg3NF4Z4xqArT4Z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ngKYg4hgBlVvjg3NF4Z4xqArT4Z.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9TlVgViCWZbBTWzWRYMPB6UxNu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i9TlVgViCWZbBTWzWRYMPB6UxNu.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fwCPpgJMV2FAqBRBif6ruSwdsvG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fwCPpgJMV2FAqBRBif6ruSwdsvG.jpg","language":"es","width":1365,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7JUiBfyH8kbyjRM0mkVSeg1zwlM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7JUiBfyH8kbyjRM0mkVSeg1zwlM.jpg","language":"es","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","u